(Page 3: Generation, Citations and Evaluation) Tj T*
T*
(During the synthesis phase, retrieved passages are formatted as untrusted) Tj T*
(reference context inside privileged system prompts, directing the language) Tj T*
(model to answer strictly based on provided evidence.) Tj T*
T*
(DocuMind AI requires answers to cite exact source filenames and page) Tj T*
(citations, such as [sample_rag_primer.pdf, p. 1], allowing students and) Tj T*
(evaluators to inspect source evidence immediately.) Tj T*
T*
(A critical invariant in trustworthy document Q&A is honest abstention. If) Tj T*
(the retrieved passages do not contain sufficient evidence to answer the) Tj T*
(query, the system must return exactly: The document does not contain this) Tj T*
(information.) Tj T*
T*
(Core evaluation metrics for production RAG include Faithfulness) Tj T*
(\(measuring factual consistency with source passages\), Answer Relevance) Tj T*
(\(ensuring the response directly addresses the query\), and Context Recall) Tj T*
(\(measuring whether all necessary information was retrieved\).) Tj T*
